[I] X FreeType library

[T] libXft is the client side font rendering library using FreeType, libX11
[T] and the X Render extension to display anti-aliased text. It uses
[T] fontconfig to locate fonts and connects X applications with the FreeType
[T] font rasterizer.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxft

[A] X.org Foundation {http://www.X.org}
